  "description": "Related articles ('Đọc tiếp') of the current article: up to 2 other articles of the same category (labels equal after trimming and ignoring case) in editorial order (position ASC, then id ASC), completed from the top of the editorial order when fewer than 2, never the current article, no duplicates.",
